@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### API status
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Collection statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats

### Ask a question
POST {{baseUrl}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the approval authority for a purchase order worth ₹1.4 crore?",
  "top_k": 2
}

### Ingest PDFs
# Requires the VS Code REST Client extension.
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingest
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="Meridian_Supply_Chain_Review_Q1_FY2025-26.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./data/Meridian_Supply_Chain_Review_Q1_FY2025-26.pdf
--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="Meridian_Procurement_Policy_Handbook_v4.2.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./data/Meridian_Procurement_Policy_Handbook_v4.2.pdf
--Boundary--
